  "totalBlocks": 28,
  "translatedBlocks": 28,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f98fab39d274a60b",
      "translationZh": "我负责维护 TensorSharp，并且在仅支持文本的 Jev 功能之外，新增了一项能力：在本地实现 Jev 的核心决策 API，并通过同一个端点接受图像输入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a5cd433ce8fb801",
      "translationZh": "它通过 POST /v1/systemone 支持 Jev 的全部三种决策类型——noul 用于真/假概率，choice 用于分类决策，score 用于基于评分标准的评分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d67c8e58e54ba2b2",
      "translationZh": "这项扩展新增了一个可选的 images 字段。端点相同、带类型的问题相同、答案结构相同——但现在决策除了可以使用文本，还可以使用像素信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7dd9dded9de90056",
      "translationZh": "具体是什么样的？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7775070b8a9b6e94",
      "translationZh": "你不必让视觉模型先生成回答，再对回答进行解析，而是可以提交一张收据并提问：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cd2f173b8d4e93c3",
      "translationZh": "总金额是否清晰可辨？→ noul",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8b9799e0e4ec01cc",
      "translationZh": "这是收据、发票，还是其他东西？→ choice",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "691b7ecee7dbcc20",
      "translationZh": "这份文档的可读性如何？→ score",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1b7d6d8e51c9fef0",
      "translationZh": "这些问题可以放在同一个请求中。例如，下面是前两个问题；请将图像占位符替换为你经过 base64 编码的 JPEG：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cfb2454157d3627f",
      "translationZh": "每个请求最多支持 8 张内联图像。图像嵌入直接输入模型的结构化决策路径——没有“先描述图像，再对描述进行分类”的中间步骤。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "11d33da02730baf9",
      "translationZh": "模型并不生成 JSON",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "396bbbffde4ce74e",
      "translationZh": "受 vLLM PR #57250 启发，TensorSharp 使用一步式结构化读取：在提示词预填充之后，从答案画布中读取所请求标签的 logits。能放进同一个画布的问题会共享同一次前向传播。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90e00b5724465857",
      "translationZh": "服务器将结果序列化为 JSON；模型无需逐个 token 生成概率 JSON。这既适用于纯文本请求，也适用于包含图像的请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d74ff2033983f809",
      "translationZh": "早期纯文本结果与 LocalJev 的对比",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19b6641555fc3752",
      "translationZh": "我之前测试了 12 个案例 × 3 次重复，每个请求包含三个决策。基线是使用 TensorSharp 的聊天端点的原版 LocalJev Engine，因此这里比较的是同一后端上的两种方法：直接结构化读取与生成概率 JSON。这并不是与官方托管的 Jev 服务或在 oMLX 上运行的 LocalJev 进行比较。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b99a372cc1ace1c7",
      "translationZh": "指标 TensorSharp 结构化读取 LocalJev 生成的 JSON",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f41630d577eb3de",
      "translationZh": "模式验证失败",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4958a800ee8f1bb3",
      "translationZh": "对有效响应作出的正确决策",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d30cbbcdd8d2d4c",
      "translationZh": "在这 27 个配对的成功请求中，LocalJev 与 TensorSharp 的延迟比值中位数为 3.345×。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d425df76ca538ef1",
      "translationZh": "几个重要细节：延迟统计仅包含成功的请求，而且内部提示词并不相同——TensorSharp 的平均输入长度为 192.7 个 token，而有效的 LocalJev 请求为 589.6 个 token。这是端到端的工作流程比较，而非使用相同提示词的内核基准测试。两种方法在返回有效响应时，所有决策都回答正确。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76c44de5cb887dd7",
      "translationZh": "这些是纯文本结果。我并未声称在图像上也能获得相同的加速效果或准确率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4bfbc5faf1c6441f",
      "translationZh": "设置指南包含启动配置和内存设置。它会下载并复用 DiffusionGemma Q4_K_M GGUF，以及一个单独的约 2.8 GB 的视觉分片。这些文件准备就绪后，推理便在本地运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12186f7dafecc4f2",
      "translationZh": "启用图像功能的服务器运行后，即可从仓库根目录运行此示例。请求文件已包含一张嵌入的合成交通信号灯图像：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d6c0d126e23d199",
      "translationZh": "该示例检查像素是否进入决策路径；它是一项冒烟测试，而非全面的视觉基准测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84ae074f8025a502",
      "translationZh": "兼容性说明：这里使用的是 DiffusionGemma 权重，而非专有的托管 Jev 模型。它支持 Jev 的核心 API 和全部三种决策类型，但不保证预测结果或限制完全一致。目前的限制包括最多 64 个问题，每个问题最多 26 个备选项。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f97bb5b3bc6079d3",
      "translationZh": "GitHub · 文档和示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e048e41d2d2cea6",
      "translationZh": "接下来，什么会成为一个有用的图像决策基准测试——收据核查、UI 截图、文档路由，还是其他需要限定范围的答案而非自由形式文本的工作负载？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b853053f39deca92",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/fuzhongkai 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
